@startuml

actor Employee

participant "Backoffice UI" as UI
participant "Backoffice API" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB

Employee -> UI :
Username + Password

UI -> API :
POST /login

API -> DB :
Find user

DB --> API :
User

API -> API :
Verify Argon2 password

API --> UI :
JWT Token

UI --> Employee :
Dashboard

@enduml